CHAPTER.VERS:
And you will speak to the sons of Israel, saying, If a man dies, and has no son, then you

          {+}
         will cause his inheritance to pass to his daughter.

And if he has no daughter, then you

          {+}
         will give his inheritance to his brothers.

And if he has no brothers, then you

          {+}
         will give his inheritance to his father's brothers.

And if his father has no brothers, then you

          {+}
         will give his inheritance to his kinsman who is next to him of his family, and he will possess it: and it will be to the sons of Israel a statute [and] ordinance, as Yahweh commanded Moses.

because you

          {+}
         rebelled against my word in the wilderness of Zin, in the strife of the congregation, to sanctify me at the waters before their eyes. (These are the waters of Meribah of Kadesh in the wilderness of Zin.)
